---
const { route = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section
  class:list={["services-section", "section-pad", { "route-section": route }]}
  id="services"
  aria-labelledby="services-heading"
>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-topline">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / The approach</p>
      <span class="small-label">Made with intent.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        {route ? (
          <h1 id="services-heading">
            Good design.
            <br />
            <span>Better business.</span>
          </h1>
        ) : (
          <h2 id="services-heading">
            Good design.
            <br />
            <span>Better business.</span>
          </h2>
        )}
      </div>
      <p>
        A compelling first impression.
        <br />A clear next step.
        <br />
        Every detail has a job to do.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-list">
      <article class="service-row">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Custom design.</h3>
        <p>
          Strong typography, thoughtful color, and a visual identity that feels
          like your business. An experience worth remembering.
        </p>
        <span class="service-label">Distinct by design.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="service-row">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Responsive development.</h3>
        <p>
          Purposeful motion and intuitive interactions bring the experience to
          life, with layouts that work on phones, tablets, and desktops.
        </p>
        <span class="service-label">Made to move.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="service-row">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>A clear path forward.</h3>
        <p>
          Well-organized pages, descriptive URLs, and search-friendly structure
          help people find your business and understand what you offer.
        </p>
        <span class="service-label">Structure & discovery.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="service-row">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Attention into action.</h3>
        <p>
          Readable content, clear navigation, and straightforward contact links
          make it easy for customers to take the next step.
        </p>
        <span class="service-label">Built around your goals.</span>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="section-bottom">
      <p>
        Your scope, features, and launch plan are agreed before work begins.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href={route ? "/pricing/" : "#pricing"}>
        Explore the packages
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
